    "title": "Fiesta Grande to celebrate Surprise culture on Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago A classic car show will be part of the festivities at the Surprise Fiesta Grande on Oct. 10 at Mark Coronado Park. Surprise Fiesta Grande, one of the city’s favorite cultural community celebrations, is back from 5-10 p.m. on Saturday, Oct. 10 at Mark Coronado Park, 15960 N. Bullard Ave.\nThis event will feature authentic Mexican food and an exciting lineup of activities and entertainment, including mariachi music, folklórico dancing, a car show, Lucha Voz wrestling, piñata busts, a petting zoo and inflatables.\n1",
